      "snippet": {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "normalizedBox A L = {x | ∀ j, |x j - nativeSpacing L.1 * (L.2.1 j : ℝ)| ≤ A * nativeSpacing L.1}, with nativeSpacing n = (n ^ 6)⁻¹ = S_n^{-3} and ChartScales.S n = n ^ 2, i.e. the mesh of size S_ℓ^{-3} with S_ℓ = ℓ^2 of the paper"
      }
